## Why This Is Asked
Practical beginner task validating end-to-end ingestion, data quality, and cataloging.

## Key Concepts
- S3 event-driven ETL
- Glue Spark/DynamicFrame validation
- Quarantine routing for bad records
- Parquet partitioning by date
- Glue Data Catalog and Athena access

## Code Example
```javascript
// Pseudo Glue-like JS snippet for validation
function process(batch){
  const valid=[], quarantined=[];
  for (const r of batch){
    if (r.a != null && r.b != null) valid.push(transform(r));
    else quarantined.push({row:r, validation_reason:'missing_required_fields'});
  }
  writeParquet(valid, datePartition);
  writeJson(quarantined, quarantineBucket);
}
```

